div.p:
Your friendly message to Edith shall not be forgotten.
              I believe she will leave Taunton for London on the 25th of this month; but <whether> Lady MaletLady Susanna Malet, née Wales (1779–1868), the widow of Sir Charles Malet, 1st Baronet (1752–1815;
                 DNB). whom she there rejoins, means to make any tarriance upon the road, I do not yet know.
